# Impeccable working artifacts — review screenshots, concept sketches and the
# decision payload. Kept on disk as a record of the redesign, but they are
# scratch output rather than product code, so they stay out of the repo.
# design.json and surfaces/ are deliberately NOT ignored: they are the design
# system tokens and the direction contract, which the build and future work read.
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/sketches/
.impeccable/payload-surface.json
